==={{stat|Speed}} for Farming Crops===
One of the criteria optimized while Farming is the {{blue|rate at which the player breaks crops}} or <math>\text{Blocks per Second}</math> or <math>\text{BpS}</math>. Because Minecraft Time flows at {{green|20}} ticks per second and that the player can break at most {{green|1}} block per tick, this means the upper bound for <math>\text{Blocks per Second}</math> is {{green|20}}.

To attain this {{green|20 BpS}} bound, one can adjust:
* their {{blue|farm design}} (e.g. planting {{green|4}} rows of crops instead of {{green|3}});
* their {{blue|orientation}} ({{Abbr|e.g.|"Exempli gratia" or more commonly "for example"}} looking up, looking down);
* their {{blue|controls}} (e.g. pressing {{keypress|W}} and {{keypress|D}} at once, pressing {{keypress|D}} only);
* their {{blue|motion}} (e.g. walking on {{Item|Soul Sand}}, adjust the {{stat|speed}} value).

