'''IMPORTANT NOTE:''' {{Skl|Farming|XP}} is received per crop block broken, not per item obtained. This means that {{Statname|Farming Fortune}} and {{Statname|Crop Fortune}} do not affect the rate of XP gain.
=== Garden Milestones ===
{{Main|The Garden}}
Garden Milestones grant players a flat amount of {{Skl|Farming|XP}} when reaching a new tier. For '''Crop Milestones''', this ranges from {{Skill XP|100–50,000 [[Farming]]}} and for '''Unique Visitors Served''' it ranges from {{Skill XP|500–30,000 [[Farming]]}} and for '''Offers Accepted''' it ranges from {{Skill XP|500–50,000 [[Farming]]}}. 

This XP gain is {{red|not}} affected by {{stat|Farming Wisdom}}.
=== Pests ===
All [[Pests]] grant a raw amount of {{skill XP|+1500 [[Farming]]}}, except for {{MobSprite|Field Mouse}} which grants {{Skill XP|+6000 [[Farming]]}}.
