{{See also|Greenhouse}}

=== Visitors ===
{{See also|Visitors}}
* Accepting visitors on the [[Garden]] grants {{skl|Farming|XP}}.
* {{Skl|Farming|XP}} is determined with this formula: <math>\text{Farming XP} = \text{Base Items} \times \text{Item Farming XP} \times \text{Visitor Rarity Multiplier}</math>{{Confirm}}.
**<math>\text{Base Items}</math> is from the [[#Requests|Requests]] formula)<br>
**<math>\text{Visitor Rarity Multiplier}</math> is determined by the '''Visitor's''' Rarity:
