=== Item Abilities ===
Abilities of some items gain a bonus depending on player's '''Farming''' level
*{{Item|Farmer Boots}} gain {{stat|def|2}} and {{stat|SPD|4}}. Additionally, it gains {{stat|FmF|1}} per '''Farming''' level while on [[The Garden]].
*{{Item|Rancher's Boots}} gain {{stat|def|2}} and {{stat|SPD|4}}. Additionally, it gains {{stat|FmF|1}} per '''Farming''' level while on [[The Garden]].
*{{Item|Lantern Helmet}} gains {{stat|def|2}} and {{stat|HP|4}}. Additionally, it gains {{stat|FmF|1}} per '''Farming''' level while holding an axe.
*{{Item|Rose Dragon Pet}} grants the player {{stat|FmF|3}} per '''Farming''' level.

